  "definition": "sosa:System",
  "label": "ISS Orbit Track Publisher",
  "description": "Software publisher that generates predicted ISS orbit ground-track products. Propagates one full orbital period (~93 minutes) of future positions at 60-second intervals using SGP4, producing a polyline of lat/lon/alt points representing the predicted ground track. Published every 5 minutes.",
